repository-code: "https://github.com/amilovidov/ldtmp"
abstract: >-
  A protocol for pacing the emotional depth of a conversation between a person
  and an AI interviewer, using six layers, deterministic transition rules and a
  safety gate. Code decides the layer and the language model writes within it.
keywords:
  - conversational agents
  - large language models
  - conversation design
  - self-disclosure
  - engagement signals
